Package: com.catling.wifiawake
Name: wifiawake
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Prevents iOS from sleeping the WiFi radio when the screen is off. Keeps SSH reachable indefinitely by periodically pinging the gateway and re-applying power-save sysctl tunables.
Maintainer: Cat-Ling
Author: Cat-Ling
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
